    "两扇门始终亮端对应亮端、暗端对应暗端，方向相反时也不变。先看两扇门的渐变，再跟随头部点从蓝门进、橙门出。每个例子先停留，再自动穿门，最后展示穿出姿态。": "Blue and orange always map bright end to bright end and dark end to dark end. Watch the gradients, then follow the dark head marker through blue and out of orange. The mapping holds even when the portals face opposite directions. Each example pauses for observation, crosses automatically and shows the resulting pose.",
